  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>• About our brand and products:</strong><br>Voltshop is a premium electronics brand focused on innovative, high-demand tech products that combine performance, design, and everyday utility. We offer carefully selected gadgets such as smartwatches, audio devices, charging accessories, and trending tech products built to convert.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>• What makes us different:</strong><br>Unlike generic stores, Voltshop focuses on premium positioning, high-converting products, strong branding, and an optimized shopping experience designed to maximize conversions. We prioritize product quality, fast support, and attractive offers that make it easier for affiliates to sell.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>• How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Affiliates earn commissions for every successful sale generated through their unique referral link or exclusive discount coupon. The more traffic and sales you generate, the more you earn. Performance-based rewards and future bonus incentives may also be available for top partners.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>• How to promote us:</strong><br>Affiliates can promote Voltshop through Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, WhatsApp, Telegram, blogs, paid traffic, content marketing, product reviews, and personal communities. We provide tracking links and promotional tools to help maximize conversions.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>• Other information:</strong></p><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li>Cookie tracking period: 30 days</li><li>Fast approval process</li><li>Dedicated affiliate support</li><li>PIX/manual payouts (Brazil)</li><li>Exclusive promotional campaigns for affiliates</li><li>Premium products with strong market appeal</li></ul></div></div>",
